  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency protection support, including SGBV response and prevention for women and girls in Kisoro and Isingiro Districts</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to enhance the provision of protection services for women and girls to increase access to safe spaces, lifesaving services, psychosocial support, and legal aid. The project will also strengthen awareness creation on the prevention of GBV and sexual exploitation &amp; abuse in Nakivale, Oruchinga, and Kisoro and target 2,000 men and boys on male engagement for prevention and response to SGBV. This project targets 10,000 affected people with Protection activities.</narrative>
  </description>
